- Folder structure: /src/components, /src/pages, /src/admin, /src/hooks, /src/services, /src/context, /src/utils, /src/types, /src/i18n, /functions. Clean, modular, commented code.
- Seed the database with 8 sample products (sizes, color variations with images, sale on 3 of them), 4 categories, 3 shop sections, 6 sample reviews, 2 coupons, 2 processing profiles, 2 shipping profiles, default settings, so everything looks complete on first load. Provide a "Seed demo data" button in admin Settings.

